---
/**
 * The drifting glow behind the page. Fixed, so it never scrolls and every
 * panel above it can use a flat translucent fill instead of a live blur.
 *
 * Three stacked radial gradients aren't a utility in any meaningful sense, so
 * they live here rather than as an arbitrary-value `bg-[…]` in the markup.
 */
---

<div class="aurora animate-drift" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .aurora {
    position: fixed;
    inset: -20vh -10vw;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        38vw 38vw at 12% 8%,
        var(--color-glow-a),
        transparent 62%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        34vw 34vw at 88% 22%,
        var(--color-glow-b),
        transparent 60%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        40vw 40vw at 60% 92%,
        var(--color-glow-a),
        transparent 65%
      );
  }
</style>
